        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PSHLOU, Louis 3-1/8\" x 15-1/4\" Solid Brass Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian styled Louis Pushplate is based on the whimsical Rococo style first popularized in europe around 1730. It features an ornate victorian pattern edge and highly detailed plate ends. The Victorian Louis Push Plate is cast in high quality brass polished in the center to a mirror sheen. Each of the different finishes offered highlight the grand detail of the Louis 3-1/8\" x 15-1/4\" Solid Brass Push Plate. It is packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur Nostalgic Warehouse Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur PSHLOU Louis 3-1/8 x 15-1/4 Solid Brass Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 15-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose on the outside, it will still be brass material on the inside.\r\n</p>",
